#. Add-on description
#. Translators: Long description to be shown for this add-on on add-on information from add-on store
#: buildVars.py:24
msgid "This add-on allows you to save, edit and remove links to frequently visited pages.\n\n"
"Shortcut Windows+Alt+K."
msgstr "Este complemento permite-lhe guardar, editar e remover ligações a páginas frequentemente visitadas.\n\n"
"Atalho Windows+Alt+K."

